  "steps": [
    "Heat the sun-dried tomato oil in a Dutch oven over medium heat until shimmering.",
    "Add the onion and cook until translucent.",
    "Add the garlic and cook until fragrant, about 45 seconds, then stir and cook a few minutes more.",
    "Stir in the tomato paste and sun-dried tomatoes and cook until the paste deepens in color.",
    "Add the broth, cream, basil, salt, pepper, garlic powder, Italian seasoning and red pepper flakes, and boil for about 12 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the pasta, lower the heat to medium-low, and cook until al dente, about 12 minutes.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and stir in the spinach, chicken, cream cheese and parmesan until the cheeses melt.",
    "Ladle into bowls and top with more parmesan, red pepper flakes and basil."
  ],
